{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And his mother took for him a wife from the land of Egypt.</b> From the place of her family and its notables. For at first he married a wife from the daughters of Moab, and she was not fitting, and his father Abraham sent him hints through that very woman who was his wife, that he should divorce her, for she was neither compassionate nor fitting. And his mother took for him another wife, compassionate — as is found in Pirkei de-Rabbi Eliezer. And that is ״and his mother took for him״ etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:10.455990659Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}